            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita tahu loop ini berhenti?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_going = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_going == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Just keep swimming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  keep_going = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Just keep swimming\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Variabel <code>keep_going</code> diperbarui menjadi <code>False</code> di dalam blok kode</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak tahu apakah loop berhenti</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Variabel <code>keep_going</code> diperbarui menjadi <code>False</code> di dalam blok kode.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Loop di bawah ini menampilkan <code>Just keep swimming</code> satu kali.</p><p>Berapa nilai <code>keep_going</code> saat kondisi <code>while</code> diperiksa untuk kedua kalinya?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_going = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_going == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Just keep swimming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  keep_going = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Just keep swimming\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>False</code>, sehingga loop berakhir di situ.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>True</code>, karena baris pertama mengaturnya menjadi <code>True</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada pemeriksaan kedua karena loop berakhir begitu <code>keep_going</code> berubah.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>False</code>, sehingga loop berakhir di situ.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
